 "words_heard": 204,
 "words": 217,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I sent my wives and children across the Jabbok ford",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I sent the gift on ahead of me, every flock and herd",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I was left alone there on the river bank that night",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man came out of the darkness and he wrestled me till light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not let you go unless you bless me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wrestled all night long until the day was breaking",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He touched my hip and wrenched it but I'm holding on",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not let you go unless you bless me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked me what's your name, I said Jacob is my name",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The heel-grabber, the schemer, the man who carried shame",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your name will no longer be Jacob, but Israel",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have struggled with God and with men and have prevailed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not let you go unless you bless me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wrestled all night long until the day was breaking",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He touched my hip and wrenched it but I'm holding on",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not let you go unless you bless me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I named that place Peniel",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have seen God face to face",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And yet my life was spared",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sun rose above him as he passed Penuel",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
